nt you looking forward now before  you look forward though i want you to do  one of the signature things that we talk  about all the time and what is that  i want you to look for the message in  the mess what is it that you learned  about yourself  or about a job or  a boss or a um  or a kind of work that you  need to make sure you understand the  message of the mess because when you get  the emotion out of the way  guess what you always see about a job or  a breakup  that happens you always see that that  was exactly what was supposed to happen  that that job that that person that that  manager that that  focus that that was holding you back and  you were just too  scared to take the leap you were too  worried about finances you were worried  about how it looked i've been there i  get it  but you need to see the message in the  mess because i don't want you to make  the mistake and step into the exact same  thing  or the exact same type of job or the  exact same management  situation that didn't work the first  time because  part of the reason why jobs don't work  is it's not a fit  you see people get fired for a lot of  reasons some of the reasons why people  get fired is because the companies  are not doing well and in that case you  want to thank your lucky stars that  you're getting out now so that you can  find something better  if it's not a fit that's a more nuanced  reason to get fired but let me tell you  something if it's not a fit for the  company  it wasn't a fit for you either and so  look for the message in the mess what  are you going to learn about this  situation whether there was a skill gap  and you need to bring your skills up to  speed so that you're not floundering  your next job  or maybe it was a personality gap that  you accepted something  that in your heart you knew wasn't right  but you took it because you had to  or because you felt insecure don't make  that mistake again  if you want to know the five morning  routines that will transform your life  check out the video right there next to  me i think you'll enjoy it continue to  believe  and i'll see you there all right let's  be honest how many of y'all get up and  you just get your day started you don't  have it written down  you don't have a strategy you don't have  a real plan you kind of just get up and  say i'm about to tackle today  raise your hand for me raise your hand  we're going to stop
 

